1
00:00:00,380 --> 00:00:03,380
(Howard:)The application in your hand.
Give it to her.

2
00:00:03,550 --> 00:00:05,010
(Sheldon:)Oh.

3
00:00:08,096 --> 00:00:10,226
(DMV Lady(to the person ahead of Sheldon in the queue):)Take this to the testing area.
Name at the top.

4
00:00:10,390 --> 00:00:13,100
(DMV Lady(to the person ahead of Sheldon in the queue):)Sign the bottom, answer the questions,
bring it back. Next.

5
00:00:13,268 --> 00:00:16,978
(Sheldon:)Excuse me, but I have some concerns
about these questions.

6
00:00:17,897 --> 00:00:19,817
(DMV Lady:)Look at that sign up there.

7
00:00:19,983 --> 00:00:23,613
- Yes?
- Does it say, "I give a damn"?

8
00:00:25,697 --> 00:00:28,237
(Leonard:)- No.
- That's because I don't.

9
00:00:28,658 --> 00:00:31,448
(Sheldon:)Just look.
See, this first question makes no sense.

10
00:00:31,619 --> 00:00:35,249
Look, "How many car lengths should you
leave in front of you when driving?"

11
00:00:35,415 --> 00:00:37,625
(Sheldon:)There's no possible way to answer that.

12
00:00:37,792 --> 00:00:41,382
(Sheldon:)A car length is not
a standardized unit of measure.

13
00:00:42,213 --> 00:00:44,043
(DMV Lady:)Look at the sign.

14
00:00:44,632 --> 00:00:47,722
- Sheldon, it's C. Just put down C.
- I don't need your help, Penny.

15
00:00:47,886 --> 00:00:50,636
- Listen to that little girl, honey. Put C. Next.
SHELDON: No, no.

16
00:00:50,805 --> 00:00:53,225
(Sheldon:)Wait, no, hang on.
Take a look at this next question.

17
00:00:53,391 --> 00:00:56,891
(Scene:)Sheldon,
why are you arguing with the DMV?

18
00:00:57,061 --> 00:01:01,021
(Sheldon:)How else are they going to learn?

